    {
      "bbox": [
        257,
        1196,
        1808,
        1615
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "It has been brought to the attention of the Mayor that from time to time jobs were available in various City Departments for which persons receiving assistance from the Department of Welfare could qualify. The Department of Welfare, however, was not informed of these opportunities until after the jobs were filled.",
