    {
      "bbox": [
        265,
        1632,
        1873,
        2154
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The Mayor directs, therefore, that whenever jobs become available in City Departments, for which persons receiving assistance from the Department of Welfare could qualify, notification thereof shall be sent to the Central Employment Unit of the Department of Welfare, 902 Broadway, New York 10, N. Y., attention of Mrs. Helen Rosenbaum (Gramercy 5-3500, Ext. 98 or 317).",
